Error [E0107]: Nothing named `null` exists here
  --> semantic_capture_walker_covers_fallback_and_scope_member_arguments.jet:2:33
    |
  2 | fn missing() -[]> Int? { return null }
    |                                 ^^^^
 Why: A name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: Declare it first: `null :: ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0107

Error [E0204]: `values` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> semantic_capture_walker_covers_fallback_and_scope_member_arguments.jet:10:46
    |
 10 |         found :: missing() ?? panic("length {values.len()}")
    |                                              ^^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through the write-access marker `&`, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass the write-access marker `&` (`&values`) only once, or copy first with `~values`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
